THE VERDANT PAGE — Project Summary
Generated: 2 May 2026
================================================================================

OVERVIEW
--------
The Verdant Page is a professional nature writing platform built on:
  - Frontend:  React 19 + Vite (TypeScript), Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, Framer Motion
  - Backend:   Express 5 (TypeScript, ESM), Pino structured logging
  - Database:  PostgreSQL via Drizzle ORM
  - Monorepo:  pnpm workspaces
  - Deployed:  Replit (frontend port 22885, API port 8080)


