DATABASE SCHEMA
---------------
Table                 Key Columns
articles              id, slug, title, content, category, status, featured,
                      view_count, word_count, read_time, image_url,
                      seo_title, seo_description, published_at
article_tags          article_id, tag_id
tags                  id, slug, name
categories            id, slug, name, description
species               id, slug, common_name, scientific_name, kingdom,
                      conservation_status, article_id (FK), image_url
portfolio_clips       id, title, publication, category, url, date
contact_messages      id, name, email, subject, message, is_read, created_at
newsletter_subs       id, email, name, created_at (unique on email)
page_views            id, path, referrer, created_at


